# Test coverage output
coverage

# The repo root ignores **/vite.config.js and **/package-lock.json — patterns
# inherited from the Flutter and React Native projects alongside this one.
# Both files are load-bearing here: without vite.config.js a clone has no React
# plugin and no test config and cannot build, and without the lockfile an
# install is not reproducible. A .gitignore nearer the file wins over one in a
# parent directory, so these two negations rescue them without touching the
# shared root file.
!vite.config.js
!package-lock.json
